This is an independent implementation. It shares no source with that project and
was written against the DataCore record schema directly. The proprietary DFP
pricing engine carved out of that repository's licence is not used, referenced,
or reimplemented here.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party tools

StarBreaker (https://github.com/diogotr7/StarBreaker) is invoked as an external
executable. It is not bundled or redistributed.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Game content

This tool ships no game content. It reads files from an installation the user
already has, and writes JSON describing what it finds.

